:: Deadwood Orchard Alex
<<set $outside to 1>><<farm_work_update>><<effects>>
<!-- 本页与后续链接共用临时变量，普通 passage 没有宏内变量帧。 -->
<<set _orchardAlex to maplebirch.get('Orchard')>>
<<if _orchardAlex?.canTalkAlex and C.npc.Alex.state is 'active' and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck and !$eventforced>>
  <<npc Alex>><<person1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
    Alex comes out with a pencil still tucked behind <<his>> ear. "Everything all right?" <<He>> looks over the trees, then back at you. "Ah. You wanted company. That's a better sort of interruption."
    <<option 'CN'>>
    艾利克斯走出来，耳后还夹着一支铅笔。“都还好吧？”<<He>>先看了一圈果树，才回头看你。“噢，你是想找人陪陪。这样打断我倒挺好。”
  <</language>><br><br>
  <div id='deadwood-orchard-alex'>
    <<if _orchardAlex.remy.farmConflict and ($Orchard.remy.visits gt 0 or $Orchard.remy.dates gt 0 or $Orchard.remy.romance)>>
      <<lanLink ['Tell Alex about seeing Remy (0:10)', '坦白与雷米的来往 (0:10)']>>
        <<farm_work_update>>
        <<if C.npc.Alex.state is 'active' and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck and !$eventforced and maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.canTalkAlex>>
          <<set $Orchard.alex_talk_day to Time.days>><<pass 10>>
          <<if C.npc.Alex.state is 'active' and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck and !$eventforced>><<set _alex_remy_answered to false>>
          <<replace '#deadwood-orchard-alex'>>
            <<language>>
              <<option 'EN'>>
                Alex takes the pencil from behind <<his>> ear. "Remy?" You explain that you met at the riding school. <<if $Orchard.remy.romance>>You tell <<him>> about the relationship, too. Alex looks away, pressing the pencil against <<his>> palm.<<else>>Alex waits until you have finished, without looking back at the trees.<</if>>
                <br><br>
                "I know what <<nnpc_he 'Remy'>> looks like when <<nnpc_he 'Remy'>> wants something." <<His>> voice rises, and <<he>> lowers it again. "You were here. You saw what <<nnpc_he 'Remy'>> did. A nice afternoon doesn't wipe that out."
                <br><br>
                <<if C.npc.Alex.dom gte 20>>"I'm not having <<nnpc_him 'Remy'>> walk through here because <<nnpc_he 'Remy'>> smiles at you."<<else>>"I've worked too hard to keep this place. Don't let <<nnpc_him 'Remy'>> use you to get at it."<</if>>
              <<option 'CN'>>
                艾利克斯取下耳后的铅笔。“雷米？”你解释说，是在骑术学校见的。<<if $Orchard.remy.romance>>你也说了你们正在交往。艾利克斯移开目光，将铅笔抵在掌心。<<else>>艾利克斯等你说完，没有再回头看那些果树。<</if>>
                <br><br>
                “<<nnpc_He 'Remy'>>想得到什么的时候，我知道<<nnpc_he 'Remy'>>是什么样。”<<His>>声音扬了起来，又压下去。“你当时在这里。你看见<<nnpc_he 'Remy'>>做过什么。跟你客气一个下午，可抹不掉那些事。”
                <br><br>
                <<if C.npc.Alex.dom gte 20>>“我不会因为<<nnpc_he 'Remy'>>对你笑一笑，就放<<nnpc_him 'Remy'>>进来。”<<else>>“我费了那么多工夫才守住这里。别让<<nnpc_him 'Remy'>>利用你打这地方的主意。”<</if>>
            <</language>><br><br>
            <<lanLink ['Promise to keep defending the farm', '答应继续守住农场']>>
              <<if !_alex_remy_answered and C.npc.Alex.state is 'active' and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck and !$eventforced>>
                <<set _alex_remy_answered to true>><<npcincr Alex love 1>>
                <<replace '#deadwood-orchard-alex'>>
                  <<language>>
                    <<option 'EN'>>
                      You tell Alex that the land and the orchard are staying here. <<He>> watches your face, then puts the pencil back behind <<his>> ear. "Good. Then that's what we keep doing." <<He>> looks towards the fence. "You'll be here when they come?" You say you will. <span class='green'><<He>> believes you mean it.</span>
                    <<option 'CN'>>
                      你告诉艾利克斯，土地和果园都会留在这里。<<He>>看着你的脸，才把铅笔夹回耳后。“好。那我们就继续守着。”<<He>>望向围栏。“他们来的时候，你会在吧？”你说会。<span class='green'><<He>>相信你会说到做到。</span>
                  <</language>><<glove 'Alex'>>
                <</replace>>
              <</if>>
            <</lanLink>><<glove 'Alex'>><br>
            <<lanLink ['Insist on choosing who you see', '坚持自主决定往来']>>
              <<if !_alex_remy_answered and C.npc.Alex.state is 'active' and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck and !$eventforced>>
                <<set _alex_remy_answered to true>><<npcincr Alex love -1>>
                <<replace '#deadwood-orchard-alex'>>
                  <<language>>
                    <<option 'EN'>>
                      "I can't make you choose." Alex turns the pencil between <<his>> fingers. "But don't ask me to trust <<nnpc_him 'Remy'>>." <<He>> heads back towards the farmhouse. <span class='purple'>You have kept your choice. Alex has kept <<his>> doubts.</span>
                    <<option 'CN'>>
                      “我没法替你选。”艾利克斯用手指转着铅笔。“但别要我信任<<nnpc_him 'Remy'>>。”<<He>>转身走向农舍。<span class='purple'>你保留了自己的选择，艾利克斯也没有放下疑虑。</span>
                  <</language>><<llove 'Alex'>>
                <</replace>>
              <</if>>
            <</lanLink>><<llove 'Alex'>><br>
          <</replace>><</if>>
        <</if>>
      <</lanLink>><br>
    <</if>>
    <<lanLink ['Walk the rows together (0:15)', '在果树间走走 (0:15)']>>
      <<farm_work_update>>
      <<if C.npc.Alex.state is 'active' and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck and !$eventforced and maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.canTalkAlex>>
        <<set $Orchard.alex_talk_day to Time.days>>
        <<tending 1>><<tiredness 1>><<npcincr Alex love 1>><<pass 15>>
        <<if !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck and !$eventforced>><<replace '#deadwood-orchard-alex'>>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
            <<if !$Orchard.farm.some(tree => tree)>>
              Alex crouches at the edge of a planting plot and lifts a grass root from the loose soil. "Best get these out before planting. Easier now than when they're tangled round a tree."
            <<elseif Time.season is 'winter'>>
              Alex presses <<his>> boot into the ground beside a tree. "Watch for water sitting here. Roots don't like being cold and wet any more than we do." <<He>> crouches to check the bark, brushing a little soil away with <<his>> thumb.
            <<elseif Time.season is 'spring'>>
              Alex lifts a branch between two fingers, careful not to knock the buds. "Plenty of flowers isn't a promise. Weather gets the final say." <<He>> shows you where two branches rub together, and marks the spot to deal with later.
            <<else>>
              Alex stops at a fork in the branches. "Heavy crop needs room. Leave everything on, and you'll spend the harvest picking small fruit." <<He>> shows you how to spot a crowded branch without breaking off anything healthy.
            <</if>>
            <br><br>
            <<if maplebirch.get('Orchard').irrigated>>
              "Glad we got the water sorted. Carrying buckets all day would put anyone off." <<He>> follows the channel with you, clearing a fallen leaf from the opening.
            <<else>>
              "We'll want the irrigation out this far eventually. One less job to worry about." <<He>> glances towards the farmhouse. "One less excuse for me to sit at that desk, too."
            <</if>>
            <br><br>
            <<if $Orchard.farm.some(tree => tree?.fruit?.length gt 0)>>
              Alex holds a low branch clear while you inspect the fruit. "Have a look underneath, too. Birds get the easy ones." <<He>> turns a leaf over, showing you where to check, then lets the branch settle without picking anything.
            <<elseif $Orchard.farm.some(tree => tree?.harvests gt 0)>>
              "Looks different with the baskets gone." Alex walks beside you, checking the ground for fallen fruit. "Still plenty to do. Least we know what all the waiting was for."
            <<elseif $Orchard.farm.some(tree => tree and maplebirch.get('Orchard').stage(tree) lt 2)>>
              You stop beside one of the young trees. Alex straightens its stake and presses the loosened earth down with <<his>> boot. "Not much to look at yet. Give it time."
            <<else>>
              Alex walks the rows with you, nudging a loose stone off the path. "Got a bit of room to work with. Think about what you'd like to eat, too."
            <</if>>
            <br><br>
            <<if isLoveInterest('Alex')>>
              Alex reaches for your hand as you leave the row. <<if C.npc.Alex.dom lte -10>>"No hurry getting back, is there?" <<He>> smiles at you from beneath <<his>> hat.<<else>>"Come on, partner. If we stand here much longer, I'll start finding more work for us." <<He>> grins.<</if>>
            <<else>>
              "Couldn't have got all this going alone," <<he>> adds, giving the row one last look before you head back.
            <</if>>
            <<option 'CN'>>
            <<if !$Orchard.farm.some(tree => tree)>>
              艾利克斯在一块种植区边缘蹲下，从松土里拎出一条草根。“栽树前，先把这些弄干净。总比以后缠上树根好收拾。”
            <<elseif Time.season is 'winter'>>
              艾利克斯用靴尖踩了踩树旁的土地。“留意这里有没有积水。树根跟我们一样，都不喜欢又冷又湿。”<<He>>蹲下检查树皮，用拇指拨开一点泥土。
            <<elseif Time.season is 'spring'>>
              艾利克斯用两根手指托起枝条，小心避开花芽。“花多也不代表一定能丰收。最后还得看天气。”<<He>>指给你看两根互相摩擦的枝条，在那里做了个记号，留待以后处理。
            <<else>>
              艾利克斯在枝杈前停下。“果子多，也得长得开。什么都舍不得摘，到时候就只能收一堆小果子。”<<He>>教你辨认过于拥挤的枝条，没有折掉健康的树枝。
            <</if>>
            <br><br>
            <<if maplebirch.get('Orchard').irrigated>>
              “幸好把水的问题解决了。整天提水桶，谁都会嫌烦。”<<He>>陪你沿水道走，清掉堵在口子上的一片落叶。
            <<else>>
              “以后得把灌溉接到这里，能少操一份心。”<<He>>望了眼农舍。“也能让我少找一个坐在书桌前的借口。”
            <</if>>
            <br><br>
            <<if $Orchard.farm.some(tree => tree?.fruit?.length gt 0)>>
              你查看果实时，艾利克斯替你托住一根低垂的枝条。“下面也看看。鸟专挑好够的啄。”<<He>>翻开一片叶子，指给你看该检查的地方，没有采摘，便小心放回枝条。
            <<elseif $Orchard.farm.some(tree => tree?.harvests gt 0)>>
              “篮子搬走，看着还真不一样。”艾利克斯走在你身旁，留意着地上有没有落果。“活还是不少。至少知道先前没白等。”
            <<elseif $Orchard.farm.some(tree => tree and maplebirch.get('Orchard').stage(tree) lt 2)>>
              你们在一棵小树旁停下。艾利克斯扶正支桩，用靴子踩实松动的泥土。“现在还看不出什么。再等等吧。”
            <<else>>
              艾利克斯陪你走过种植区，用靴子将一块松动的石头拨离小路。“地方有了。也想想自己爱吃什么吧。”
            <</if>>
            <br><br>
            <<if isLoveInterest('Alex')>>
              离开树行时，艾利克斯牵住你的手。<<if C.npc.Alex.dom lte -10>>“不用急着回去吧？”<<He>>从帽檐下望着你，笑了笑。<<else>>“走吧，亲爱的。再站下去，我又该给咱俩找活干了。”<<He>>咧嘴笑了。<</if>>
            <<else>>
              “一个人可弄不出这么大一片。”<<He>>又补了一句。你们回去前，<<he>>又沿着树行看了一遍。
            <</if>>
          <</language>><<gtending>><<gtiredness>><<glove 'Alex'>>
        <</replace>><</if>>
      <</if>>
    <</lanLink>><<gtending>><<gtiredness>><br>
    <<lanLink ['Take a break by the hedge (0:20)', '在树篱旁休息 (0:20)']>>
      <<farm_work_update>>
      <<if C.npc.Alex.state is 'active' and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck and !$eventforced and maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.canTalkAlex>>
        <<set $Orchard.alex_talk_day to Time.days>>
        <<stress -6>><<tiredness -40>><<npcincr Alex love 1>><<pass 20>>
        <<if !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck and !$eventforced>><<replace '#deadwood-orchard-alex'>>
          <<set _alexWine to maplebirch.get('Orchard').winery.terms.recipes.find(recipe => $Orchard.winery.stock[recipe.id] gt 0)>>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
            <<if Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>
              Rain begins dripping through the hedge before you settle. Alex laughs, catches your sleeve and leads you to the lean-to instead. "Good spot. Shame about the roof." <<He>> brushes water from the bench and leaves the dry end for you.
            <<else>>
              Alex spreads an old sack on the ground before sitting. "Don't tell the others. They'll think I'm slacking." <<He>> shifts over to make room, stretching <<his>> legs with a sigh. The farmhouse phone rings in the distance. For once, <<he>> lets it.
            <</if>>
            <br><br>
            <<if isLoveInterest('Alex')>>
              "Stay a bit," <<he>> says when you begin to move. <<if C.npc.Alex.dom lte -30>><<His>> hand hovers beside yours. "If you want."<<else>><<He>> pats the space beside <<him>>. "The trees can manage without us for twenty minutes."<</if>>
            <<else>>
              Alex pulls a blade of grass apart between <<his>> fingers. "Used to think I'd get a quiet moment once the animals were fed." <<He>> glances towards the yard, and laughs. "Then they'd want feeding again."
            <</if>>
            <<if _alexWine>>
              <br><br>You mention the <<= _alexWine.name[0].toLowerCase()>> bottled at the winery.
              <<switch _alexWine.id>>
                <<case 'cider'>>"Cider, eh?" Alex grins. "All that time hauling apples about, and you found a way to make them more tempting."
                <<case 'perry'>>"Pear cider?" Alex tips <<his>> hat back. "Better keep me away from it till the work's done. Heavy baskets and a light head don't mix."
                <<case 'plum_wine'>>"Always seems a shame when the plum season ends." Alex stretches <<his>> legs. "Nice to have something left when the branches are bare."
                <<case 'cherry_wine'>>"Cherry wine?" Alex chuckles. "Getting those little buggers off the trees is enough work. Hope you left yourself a few to eat."
              <</switch>>
            <</if>>
            <<option 'CN'>>
            <<if Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>
              你们还没坐好，雨水便开始穿过树篱往下滴。艾利克斯笑着拉了拉你的衣袖，带你去棚下。“地方不错，可惜没个好屋顶。”<<He>>拂去长凳上的水，把干燥的一端留给你。
            <<else>>
              艾利克斯铺好一只旧麻袋，才坐下。“别告诉别人，不然他们要说我偷懒了。”<<He>>往旁边挪出空位，叹着气伸直双腿。远处响起农舍的电话声。这一次，<<he>>没有去接。
            <</if>>
            <br><br>
            <<if isLoveInterest('Alex')>>
              你刚要起身，<<he>>便说：“再待会儿。”<<if C.npc.Alex.dom lte -30>><<His>>手停在你的手旁。“你愿意的话。”<<else>><<He>>拍了拍身旁的空位。“少了我们二十分钟，树也不会跑。”<</if>>
            <<else>>
              艾利克斯用手指撕着一片草叶。“以前总想着，把牲口喂完就能清静一会儿。”<<He>>朝院子看了一眼，笑了。“结果还没歇够，它们又该吃了。”
            <</if>>
            <<if _alexWine>>
              <br><br>你说起酿酒间装好的<<= _alexWine.name[1]>>。
              <<switch _alexWine.id>>
                <<case 'cider'>>“苹果酒啊。”艾利克斯咧嘴笑了。“搬了那么久的苹果，你还真能想出办法，让人更惦记它们。”
                <<case 'perry'>>“梨酒？”艾利克斯抬了抬帽檐。“得干完活再喝。头轻脚飘的，可搬不动那些篮子。”
                <<case 'plum_wine'>>“每次李子收完，总觉得少了点什么。”艾利克斯伸了伸腿。“枝头空了，还能留下一点，也挺好。”
                <<case 'cherry_wine'>>“樱桃酒？”艾利克斯轻笑一声。“从树上摘下那些小东西就够忙的了。没全拿去酿吧？给自己留些吃。”
              <</switch>>
            <</if>>
          <</language>><<lstress>><<ltiredness>><<glove 'Alex'>>
        <</replace>><</if>>
      <</if>>
    <</lanLink>><<lstress>><<ltiredness>><br>
    <<farmicon 'alexbed'>><<lanLink ["Alex's room (0:01)", '艾利克斯的房间 (0:01)'] 'Farm Alex Bedroom'>><<pass 1>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
    <<if ($foodstuff.apple?.amount ?? 0) gt ($Orchard.reserve.apple ?? 0)>>
      <<foodstufficon 'apple'>><<lanLink ['Share an apple (0:10)', '分一个苹果吃 (0:10)']>>
        <<farm_work_update>>
        <<if C.npc.Alex.state is 'active' and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck and !$eventforced and maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.canTalkAlex and ($foodstuff.apple?.amount ?? 0) gt ($Orchard.reserve.apple ?? 0)>>
          <<set $Orchard.alex_talk_day to Time.days>><<set $foodstuff.apple.amount-->>
          <<npcincr Alex love 2>><<pass 10>>
          <<if !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck and !$eventforced>><<replace '#deadwood-orchard-alex'>>
            <<language>>
              <<option 'EN'>>
              Alex takes the apple and produces a clean pocketknife. "Half each?" <<He>> cuts it over <<his>> palm, offering you the larger piece. Juice runs over <<his>> thumb. "Could do with more lunches like this."
              <br><br>
              <<if $Orchard.farm.some(tree => tree?.species is 'apple' and tree.harvests gt 0)>>
                "Those apple trees of yours have earned their place." <<He>> looks along the row. "Might save some for a crumble next time. Now that's worth coming in for."
              <<else>>
                "Worth taking a break now and then." <<He>> nods towards the trees. "Even if the work's still there when we get up."
              <</if>>
              <<option 'CN'>>
              艾利克斯接过苹果，拿出一把干净的折刀。“一人一半？”<<He>>托着苹果切开，把大一些的那块递给你。果汁沿拇指淌下来。“午饭能常这样吃就好了。”
              <br><br>
              <<if $Orchard.farm.some(tree => tree?.species is 'apple' and tree.harvests gt 0)>>
                “你那些苹果树没白种。”<<He>>沿着树行望过去。“下回可以留些做苹果酥。那我可得早早回屋等着。”
              <<else>>
                “偶尔歇歇也不错。”<<He>>朝果树点点头。“就算站起来以后，活还是一样多。”
              <</if>>
            <</language>><br><br>
            <<language>>
              <<option 'EN'>>
                <<if isLoveInterest('Alex')>>
                  You catch Alex watching you rather than the apple. <<if C.npc.Alex.dom lte -10>><<He>> blushes when you look back. "What? Can't I enjoy the company?"<<else>>"Careful," <<he>> says, smiling. "Keep feeding me and I might follow you round all day."<</if>>
                <<else>>
                  Alex wipes <<his>> fingers on a clean handkerchief before putting the knife away. "Better than eating on my feet. Thanks for stopping me."
                <</if>>
              <<option 'CN'>>
                <<if isLoveInterest('Alex')>>
                  你发现艾利克斯没在看苹果，而是在看你。<<if C.npc.Alex.dom lte -10>>你望回去，<<he>>有些脸红。“怎么了？就不能看看你吗？”<<else>>“小心点。”<<He>>笑着说。“老这么喂我，我可要整天跟着你了。”<</if>>
                <<else>>
                  艾利克斯用一条干净手帕擦了擦手指，才收起折刀。“比站着吃强。多亏你叫我歇歇。”
                <</if>>
            <</language>><<glove 'Alex'>>
          <</replace>><</if>>
        <</if>>
      <</lanLink>><br>
    <</if>>
  </div>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Alex cannot leave the farm work right now, or you have already spent your break together today.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      艾利克斯现在离不开手头的工作，或者你们今天已经一起休息过了。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br><<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the orchard', '返回果园'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Orchard'>>
  <<if !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck and !$eventforced>>
    <<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>>
  <</if>>
<</lanLink>><br>
